    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FusUeHP1aYHKhiHWU-Q0tekeiO-L.png"></figure><p><span>这期邀请你与我一起去北海道散散步，踏踏雪。分享些不错的餐厅，希望对即将出行的你有些许帮助。而不打算去北海道的你，请听着播客与我们一起云旅行吧！</span></p><p><span>🎏</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gmDbNse-RiRVH0TkxoouWQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/gmDbNse-RiRVH0TkxoouWQ"><span>查看「北海道美食手册」</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="100">01:40</a>札幌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="712">11:52</a>小樽</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a>洞爷湖</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1988">33:08</a>函馆</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3006">50:06</a>东京</span></p><p><span>不知不觉与听众朋友们共度了15期节目，祝你2025年顺心平安，爱与被爱~</span></p><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6739ecfef373fe5d4dfab67e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6739ecfef373fe5d4dfab67e"><span>14 漫步“江城”赣州，循迹两宋与民国｜在赣南</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
