  <item>
    <title>14 漫步“江城”赣州，循迹两宋与民国｜在赣南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6739ecfef373fe5d4dfab67e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6739ecfef373fe5d4dfab67e</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 17 Nov 2024 13:50:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpWnhBv97AhbMCCDftsX5H6biHX2.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>宿白先生曾赞赣州“北宋砖城，江南独步”，怀着小期待，我来到这繁荣了宋明清三朝的商贸江城，看到它曾经的辉煌与没落后的缓慢兴盛。赣州故事已深深地刻入城市肌理，画在城市各处。游走江城，毫不意外地撞见它曾作为军事重镇的另一幅模样。这里是南康郡，是虔州，也是赣州。这里深埋着东晋的土，掩埋着萧梁时期的陈霸先故事。唐末卢光稠曾走到江边，用手指画了个圈，赣城就这样扩建到江边，成为江城。赣州成于水，又为水所困，北宋孔宗翰与刘彝的水利工程，成就了这座千年不涝的城。抗战时期这里作为“小后方”，继续着它的城市故事。#在赣南 #虔州梦华录</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌝</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484246&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6d93f511b4d11f6fef3418e97c3fa987&amp;chksm=cf5ceed8f82b67cebb1fb7ef4d99040e670985619bf10be464ea3ef33d558350af56a4e359b9#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484246&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6d93f511b4d11f6fef3418e97c3fa987&amp;chksm=cf5ceed8f82b67cebb1fb7ef4d99040e670985619bf10be464ea3ef33d558350af56a4e359b9#rd"><span>查看「赣州」图文信息</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/671e2b6544ae79002c66ef33" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/671e2b6544ae79002c66ef33"><span>13 龙南：探访客家围屋｜在赣南</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="70">01:10</a>古赣州，水陆交通枢纽</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="345">05:45</a>八境台与苏轼</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a>赣州的3个名字及5个城址</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a>北宋城墙</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1102">18:22</a>商贸江城-城门与浮桥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1570">26:10</a>福寿沟与度龙桥、水窗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2513">41:53</a>郁孤台与辛弃疾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2950">49:10</a>灶儿巷、标准钟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3122">52:02</a>蒋经国故居诉说民国往事</span></p><span></span><p><span>*赣州吃喝推荐：滨江大酒店、九品天香、老馆子、绝味虾霸、轻茶里（茶饮）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
