    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnFDOahzCF2zmJuQQDBjO1ZCToXL.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“客”从何处来？江西南端的龙南市，好吃、好玩，一座座客家围屋引导我们循迹了不曾深入了解的客家文化。# 在赣南</span></p><span></span><p><span>🍃</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484170&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=da53d5b0dc297ff380757a48e8bfeef3&amp;chksm=cf5cee84f82b67928dbdcd89a818aa405739da9fb3714c26809cec0c330e9a07fedc26b6b052#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484170&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=da53d5b0dc297ff380757a48e8bfeef3&amp;chksm=cf5cee84f82b67928dbdcd89a818aa405739da9fb3714c26809cec0c330e9a07fedc26b6b052#rd"><span>查看「探访客家围屋」图文信息</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6739ecfef373fe5d4dfab67e" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6739ecfef373fe5d4dfab67e"><span>14 漫步“江城”赣州，循迹两宋与民国｜在赣南</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="43">00:00:43</a> 龙南在哪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="340">00:05:40</a> 王阳明平“三浰之乱”，建太平桥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="825">00:13:45</a> 通岭南，大庾岭梅关古道</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">00:17:35</a> 客家人五次大迁徙路线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">00:25:20</a> 客家防御型建筑的源起</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">00:30:40</a> 燕翼围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2573">00:42:53</a> 乌石围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2910">00:48:30</a> 雅溪古村</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3250">00:54:10</a> 龙南城墙、黄道生</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3523">00:58:43</a> 关西新围</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4394">01:13:14</a> 客家饮食</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4560">01:16:00</a> 赣南客家围屋的特点与变化</span></p><span></span><p><span>*龙南餐厅推荐：厨娘</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66dd53b4bfd7110df40e7879" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66dd53b4bfd7110df40e7879"><span>12居延边塞：屯戍够苦了，还要搞绩效？| 读汉简</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
