    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FizzAKtpkEbNx1bThVkNl3S3a5Rk.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>来到居延，似乎再也无法离去。戍边的人，像野草，低微又顽强。这是《读汉简》第3集 #甘肃简牍博物馆</span></p><span></span><p><span>📝</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484130&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2faab8dcda7fe7ab1bc5c7155c58750d&amp;chksm=cf5cef6cf82b667aa9dbe0a844561ff95571e8e852b9f72760d0b58d975ce638fc89925329ef#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484130&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=2faab8dcda7fe7ab1bc5c7155c58750d&amp;chksm=cf5cef6cf82b667aa9dbe0a844561ff95571e8e852b9f72760d0b58d975ce638fc89925329ef#rd"><span>查看「居延边塞」图文信息</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6640cb3bb813c7172b97a733" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6640cb3bb813c7172b97a733"><span>09 且听 河西往事|读汉简</span></a></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66bef7e133591c27be872bfb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66bef7e133591c27be872bfb"><span>11 招待所·邮局·外事办：悬泉置的日与夜|读汉简</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">02:15</a> 官薄身贱，心里苦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="354">05:54</a> 居延地区概况</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 戍边的一日两餐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 卖鱼纠纷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1520">25:20</a> 明画天田与日迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 塞上烽火品约</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1957">32:37</a> 官吏工资与边塞物价</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2208">36:48</a> 想晋升，先付出</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2570">42:50</a> 边塞的家属们</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3033">50:33</a> 努力搞绩效</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
