  <item>
    <title>11 招待所·邮局·外事办：悬泉置的日与夜 「读汉简」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bef7e133591c27be872bfb</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bef7e133591c27be872bfb</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 16 Aug 2024 06:55:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FthSlpSB50ah_tRYGgDLCZJN9j-C.png"></figure><p><span>西汉通往西域官道上的高级别驿站【悬泉置】，隶属敦煌郡效谷县，集招待所、邮局、外事办等功能为一体，接待了为数不少的风云人物。这是《读汉简》第2集 &nbsp;#甘肃简牍博物馆</span></p><p><span>🏪</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484089&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=fa81b35531460e780822b85641f95779&amp;chksm=cf5cef37f82b6621596302f5fefa5294ffd5b2e243404af43707f06fc8b2f089b253a53e11ae#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484089&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=fa81b35531460e780822b85641f95779&amp;chksm=cf5cef37f82b6621596302f5fefa5294ffd5b2e243404af43707f06fc8b2f089b253a53e11ae#rd"><span>查看「悬泉置的日与夜」图文信息</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6640cb3bb813c7172b97a733" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6640cb3bb813c7172b97a733"><span>09 且听 河西往事|读汉简</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66dd53b4bfd7110df40e7879" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66dd53b4bfd7110df40e7879"><span>12 居延边塞：屯戍够苦了，还要搞绩效？|读汉简</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a>关于悬泉置</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="180">03:00</a>刘解忧/冯嫽/常惠/匈奴日逐王/郑吉，曾留驻</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a>悬泉置的院落格局</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="458">07:38</a>环境保护法-《四时月令诏条》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a>悬泉置的组织结构</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="698">11:38</a>悬泉厩：马匹与车辆管理</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="870">14:30</a>汉代邮件传递</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="994">16:34</a>西汉与乌孙的外交斡旋</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1333">22:13</a>简牍记事：莎车王万年、龟兹王绛宾与弟史</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a>悬泉传舍：持传信者的住宿服务</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a>简牍记事：楼兰王使团、于阗国超千人使团</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1774">29:34</a>简牍记事：匈奴日逐王降汉、西域都护府</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2043">34:03</a>悬泉置雇佣私奴婢</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2119">35:19</a>悬泉厨：忙碌的餐饮供给</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2170">36:10</a>简牍记事：公务餐、违规接待、采购清单</span></p><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66ae2d367349f7a557816ba3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66ae2d367349f7a557816ba3"><span>10 远游武威郡，遥望姑臧城</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
