  <item>
    <title>10 远游武威郡，遥望姑臧城 • 武威2日</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66ae2d367349f7a557816ba3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66ae2d367349f7a557816ba3</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 03 Aug 2024 13:14:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm5utza9Uv-KNW-vFpQjg9NM6ZTK.png"></figure><p><span>当我踏上霍去病曾策马奔腾的草原与山岭，似乎吹到来自西汉猛烈的风。千年之后，我看到北凉王沮渠蒙逊曾驻足欣赏的壁画。在这里，神秘的西夏不再神秘，党项人曾经的荣光就在我面前。# 凉州 # 河西走廊</span></p><p><span>去了：武威文庙、武威西夏博物馆、乌鞘岭与长城遗址、海藏寺与海藏公园、南城门楼、武威市博物馆。</span></p><p><span>没去：雷台汉墓、鸠摩罗什寺、大云寺、天梯山石窟。</span></p><p><span>🏔️</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484063&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=1f6b0a825ea42a4d408be91bef9290b3&amp;chksm=cf5cef11f82b6607c91aa9969dbbae95b24c2a7c8e9ee13a2afe14eadd42c1aa3beda0a3ccd9#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247484063&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=1f6b0a825ea42a4d408be91bef9290b3&amp;chksm=cf5cef11f82b6607c91aa9969dbbae95b24c2a7c8e9ee13a2afe14eadd42c1aa3beda0a3ccd9#rd"><span>查看「武威」图片信息</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">01:00</a>武威，河西之门户</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="215">03:35</a>文庙</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="488">08:08</a>西夏文物相关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="845">14:05</a>乌鞘岭与长城遗址</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1328">22:08</a>海藏寺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1705">28:25</a>南城门楼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1863">31:03</a>武威市博物馆(天梯山石窟展)</span></p><p><span>*武威吃喝推荐：和轩麻辣烫、老河州老马大盘鸡、放哈（甜胚子奶茶、杏皮酒酿）。司机推荐但没时间去的-徐栋霖牛肉面、美味烧烤店。</span></p><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6640cb3bb813c7172b97a733" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6640cb3bb813c7172b97a733"><span>09 且听 河西往事 &nbsp;| &nbsp;读汉简</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
