  <item>
    <title>09 且听 河西往事 「读汉简」</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6640cb3bb813c7172b97a733</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6640cb3bb813c7172b97a733</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 12 May 2024 13:59:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuVap7ksUpxXPcXs9L7brkuCBlk0.png"></figure><p><span>汉王朝河西走廊，当金戈铁马的喧闹褪去，丝绸之路最东端那繁荣景象，是使者相望于道，是商旅不绝于途。然而，千年之后的风吹开浮土沙石，一个个小人物的鲜活生命出现了。他们戍边、劳作，哭过、笑过、怒骂过、失落过…他们抵御外敌、他们喝酒宴请…为没衣服穿而为难、为要不到钱而发愁、为考核评级而焦虑…汉代简牍背后微小而具体的他们，让河西四郡、大汉边塞、丝绸之路从政令变成现实。这是《读汉简》第1集 &nbsp;&nbsp;#甘肃简牍博物馆</span></p><p><span>📚</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483990&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=d1a18b5d26579040d1c61755ddb55028&amp;chksm=cf5cefd8f82b66cefc382757c91c34350e54a71c97a07c7d20e2ab2dba58f54f49bc51ced0ad#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483990&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=d1a18b5d26579040d1c61755ddb55028&amp;chksm=cf5cefd8f82b66cefc382757c91c34350e54a71c97a07c7d20e2ab2dba58f54f49bc51ced0ad#rd"><span>查看「且听 河西往事」图文信息</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66ae2d367349f7a557816ba3" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66ae2d367349f7a557816ba3"><span>10 远游武威郡，遥望姑臧城</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66bef7e133591c27be872bfb" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66bef7e133591c27be872bfb"><span>11 招待所·邮局·外事办：悬泉置的日与夜|读汉简</span></a></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66dd53b4bfd7110df40e7879" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66dd53b4bfd7110df40e7879"><span>12 居延边塞：屯戍够苦了，还要搞绩效？|读汉简</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>何为简牍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="442">07:22</a>采购清单-读《元致子方书》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="710">11:50</a>月氏西迁、张骞西行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="868">14:28</a>河西之战、汉攘河西</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="943">15:43</a>何为河西四郡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1053">17:33</a>候望系统-都尉、候官、部、隧</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1158">19:18</a>边郡管理-太守与部都尉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1323">22:03</a>军事重点-居延、敦煌</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1392">23:12</a>半弧形防御-玉门关、阳关</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1475">24:35</a>后勤供给-仓、库、阁</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1523">25:23</a>邮驿系统-置及其厩、厨、传舍</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1634">27:14</a>旅行路书-读《居延里程简&amp;悬泉里程简》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1700">28:20</a>甘肃简牍出土纪事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1993">33:13</a>诀别家信-读《与昆弟书信木简》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2055">34:15</a>西汉行政建制-郡、县、乡、亭、里</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2265">37:45</a>边郡特色建制-都乡</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2366">39:26</a>河西地区的人口组成</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2535">42:15</a>西行路难-读《戍卒行道居署物故木简》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2605">43:25</a>民风彪悍-读《酗酒斗殴木简》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2707">45:07</a>丝绸之路的物产流通</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2742">45:42</a>大宛献马-读《迎天马木简》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2885">48:05</a>折垣狮子-读《钩盾使者迎狮木简》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2926">48:46</a>佛门请柬-读《浮屠木简》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2995">49:55</a>河西汉塞的贸易</span></p><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66178d5f48c40e2fb0a1d216" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66178d5f48c40e2fb0a1d216"><span>08 秩序与失序 | 浅浅浅聊中原青铜器（下）</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
