    <title>08 秩序与失序｜浅浅浅聊中原青铜器</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66178d5f48c40e2fb0a1d216</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66178d5f48c40e2fb0a1d216</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 11 Apr 2024 13:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlpDQrqh-DCtij7VfbloUrgqpaML.png"></figure><p><span>本期简单聊聊西周分封、礼乐制度的生活化表现、周代青铜食器替代商人以酒器区分等级的传统，以及青铜器的价值共识瓦解，导致东周“礼崩乐坏”。这是《浅浅浅聊中原青铜器》的第2期，灵感来自上海博物馆东馆的古代青铜馆。</span></p><p><span>🍵</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483931&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=56675ed82b16bf7321277ec6314ab462&amp;chksm=cf5cef95f82b66835de68991aeb82b71623386de0ac00aab82dfc31ea18af71481b5dab68952#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483931&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=56675ed82b16bf7321277ec6314ab462&amp;chksm=cf5cef95f82b66835de68991aeb82b71623386de0ac00aab82dfc31ea18af71481b5dab68952#rd"><span>查看「秩序与失序」图文信息</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6610076e4f66d1c1da32323a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/6610076e4f66d1c1da32323a"><span>07 古国王权 | 浅浅浅聊中原青铜器（上）</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> 西周初年“大分封”</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="239">03:59</a> 鼎，王权与阶级</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="415">06:55</a> 青铜食器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="925">15:25</a> 周代贵族吃什么</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1033">17:13</a> 青铜乐器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1366">22:46</a> 东周，礼崩乐坏的时代</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1457">24:17</a> 青铜车马器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1618">26:58</a> 中原青铜器纹饰</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1841">30:41</a> 秦灭六国</span></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
