    <guid isPermaLink="false">6610076e4f66d1c1da32323a</guid>
    <pubDate>Fri, 05 Apr 2024 14:15:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoVcimGBG9p_9qDkKM7jb47xj2c-.png"></figure><p><span>本期聚焦中原青铜文明从二里头起源至周灭商，青铜水器、兵器、酒器及其蕴含的文化信息。这是《浅浅浅聊中原青铜器》的第1期，灵感来自上海博物馆东馆的古代青铜馆。</span></p><p><span>🥃</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483872&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e609f0e18fb2f5a91eb32fc4123c353a&amp;chksm=cf5cec6ef82b65785c061aa06652bd0617f62f6c1155faf0163fe7801774e3dca6b0e32647c1#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483872&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e609f0e18fb2f5a91eb32fc4123c353a&amp;chksm=cf5cec6ef82b65785c061aa06652bd0617f62f6c1155faf0163fe7801774e3dca6b0e32647c1#rd"><span>查看「古国王权」图文信息</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66178d5f48c40e2fb0a1d216" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/66178d5f48c40e2fb0a1d216"><span>08 秩序与失序 | 浅浅浅聊中原青铜器（下）</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 觯、匜、敦，怎么读</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 净手礼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="245">04:05</a> 青铜水器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="703">11:43</a> 从铜石并用到青铜时代</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 二里头发现最早的青铜礼容器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1020">17:00</a> 青铜冶铸与原料运输</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a> 青铜促生早期国家</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1300">21:40</a> 青铜酒器</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1600">26:40</a> 青铜铭文（金文）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1995">33:15</a> 商人的信仰与祭祀</span></p><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65ff90a61519139e4f2fa450" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65ff90a61519139e4f2fa450"><span>06 云游意大利：脑瓜子嗡嗡地</span><