    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnC5J3fmfVh-r2wkoVSPcQ5bq9DW.png"></figure><p><span>晨路约上让人嫉妒的好友达摩，聊了聊她在3月的旅行体验--梵蒂冈、比萨、米兰、佛罗伦萨、威尼斯、锡耶纳、罗马…聊了些意大利的刻板印象，来听播客吧</span></p><p><span>✈️</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483800&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=07b432a1b3abc9e9c8a7465889bc1782&amp;chksm=cf5cec16f82b6500092599683d2498a2135e92140fb940c6fea62d4e47d1aa5b26097606f843#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483800&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=07b432a1b3abc9e9c8a7465889bc1782&amp;chksm=cf5cec16f82b6500092599683d2498a2135e92140fb940c6fea62d4e47d1aa5b26097606f843#rd"><span>查看：梵蒂冈与意大利的旅行图片、剧集推荐</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="115">01:55</a>梵蒂冈，美的震撼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="670">11:10</a>比萨，百闻不如一见</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="810">13:30</a>倒时差，so easy</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="940">15:40</a>意大利帅哥美女，看了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1051">17:31</a>意式英语费舌头</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1165">19:25</a>防偷盗，防碰瓷</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1430">23:50</a>米兰，匆匆一见</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1526">25:26</a>佛罗伦萨，又一次美的震撼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a>关于意大利的剧集推荐</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1682">28:02</a>在威尼斯晕船可还行</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1830">30:30</a>勇闯锡耶纳小超市</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2002">33:22</a>有被意式咖啡伤害到</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2205">36:45</a>意大利美食，吃了</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2455">40:55</a>罗马许愿池的正确打开方式</span></p><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65df0e414525864db9be69e1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65df0e414525864db9be69e1"><span>05 镇国寺&amp;双林寺：我看到了北汉和明朝的“雪”</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
