  <item>
    <title>05 镇国寺&amp;双林寺：我看到了北汉和明朝的“雪” ｜山西访古</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65df0e414525864db9be69e1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65df0e414525864db9be69e1</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 28 Feb 2024 10:43:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEFd_r4JDqTcknkum430yz3XqGr.png"></figure><p><span>平遥古城与镇国寺、双林寺并称为“一城两寺”，1997年被联合国教科文组织列为世界文化遗产。</span><strong><span>镇国寺</span></strong><span>始建于北汉天会七年，其万佛殿为我国现存最古老的木构建筑之一，殿内11尊北汉原塑延续了晚唐风格。明代重建的</span><strong><span>双林寺</span></strong><span>现存大小塑像两千余尊，具有高度写实的风格，其中水月观音、韦驮、罗汉像是明代雕塑的精品。#山西访古</span></p><p><span>🔸</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483761&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=533317e612c25cdda7eb4a59fe09be14&amp;chksm=cf5cecfff82b65e9b6a82a8227a2d84900e95472f2b0784353b74d276bb6c71ca675da80aa65#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483761&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=533317e612c25cdda7eb4a59fe09be14&amp;chksm=cf5cecfff82b65e9b6a82a8227a2d84900e95472f2b0784353b74d276bb6c71ca675da80aa65#rd"><span>查看「镇国寺&amp;双林寺」图文信息</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65b0cd6e7ce80215e566555d" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65b0cd6e7ce80215e566555d"><span>04 晋祠：如此美轮美奂，如此源深流长</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="17">00:17</a> 镇国寺</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="795">13:15</a> 双林寺</span></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
