  <item>
    <title>04 晋祠：如此美轮美奂，如此源深流长｜山西访古</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65b0cd6e7ce80215e566555d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65b0cd6e7ce80215e566555d</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 24 Jan 2024 08:42:21 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhL_gq9uFzvSU6QIM8uK6AOmm66I.png"></figure><p><span>唯有置身晋祠，才能真切感受到那扑面而来且此起彼伏的园林之美、建筑之美、历史之美。祭祀西周晋国第一任诸侯唐叔虞的晋祠，主建筑圣母殿是现存规模最大、形制等级最高的北宋木构建筑之一。圣母殿、鱼沼飞梁、献殿，是晋祠的三大国宝建筑。#山西访古</span></p><p><span>🔹</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483756&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=8973b7542c7e56dfb231f6bb72add3fb&amp;chksm=cf5cece2f82b65f4135689fd0256eca6f16e7257f5839b163609df4c3d8aeb7f6d6fb75cf8d8#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483756&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=8973b7542c7e56dfb231f6bb72add3fb&amp;chksm=cf5cece2f82b65f4135689fd0256eca6f16e7257f5839b163609df4c3d8aeb7f6d6fb75cf8d8#rd"><span>查看「晋祠」图文信息</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-相关单集-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65df0e414525864db9be69e1" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/65df0e414525864db9be69e1"><span>05 镇国寺&amp;双林寺：我看到了北汉和明朝的“雪”</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="19">00:19</a> 打工人顶着水逆gapweekend</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="399">06:39</a> 晋祠，我来啦</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="613">10:13</a> 水镜台（明清）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="789">13:09</a> 金人台（宋明）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="903">15:03</a> 对越坊（明）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1004">16:44</a> 献殿（金）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">20:33</a> 鱼沼飞梁（宋）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 梁思成与林徽因1934年山西考察</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1481">24:41</a> 晋祠主殿：圣母殿（宋）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1820">30:20</a> 关于圣母身份的讨论</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2394">39:54</a> 难老泉</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2532">42:12</a> 智伯渠（关于春秋战国）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2646">44:06</a> 唐叔虞祠（元）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2803">46:43</a> 唐太宗亲撰《晋祠铭》</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2892">48:12</a> 奉圣寺山门（元）</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3071">51:11</a> 壁画艺术博物馆</span></p><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/657557d68593f10bf9f6b246" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/657557d68593f10bf9f6b246"><span>03 华林寺：来自吴越国，长江以南最古老木构</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lmTCZko6bl_DY4guUZnk5ed5pY04.m4a" length="80922651" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:55:47</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fosy77C3dRgETxS90qeJvHDtQJPU.png"/>
