  <item>
    <title>03 华林寺：来自吴越国，长江以南最古老木构建筑</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/657557d68593f10bf9f6b246</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">657557d68593f10bf9f6b246</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 10 Dec 2023 06:16:53 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvAaKZmEgq12gvhXO2jfcaId12Fi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>福州华林寺大殿是长江以南最古老的木构建筑，964年建成。彼时是赵宋立国第5年，福州尚在吴越国治下，因此它被视为五代十国末期建筑。大殿的建筑样式被日本僧人重源引进，用来重建1180年被毁的奈良东大寺大佛殿，因此称为“大佛样”。寺内现存《宋高宗赵构御书碑》残碑，是宋高宗宠幸佞臣王继先的实物史料。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🏗️</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483734&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ce0fa96277374ca0e59364d04c183f82&amp;chksm=cf5cecd8f82b65ce682434bc1f68afdaf0c0cfa7c01c6ae18f131751f8506e12cb3180e0d321#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483734&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=ce0fa96277374ca0e59364d04c183f82&amp;chksm=cf5cecd8f82b65ce682434bc1f68afdaf0c0cfa7c01c6ae18f131751f8506e12cb3180e0d321#rd"><span>查看「华林寺」图文信息</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="25">00:25</a> 长江以南最古老木构建筑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="170">02:50</a> 南宋梁克家《三山志》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="475">07:55</a> 964年建越山吉祥禅院</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="679">11:19</a> 南唐灭国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="842">14:02</a> 闽国的建立与灭国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1353">22:33</a> 吴越国“纳土归宋”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1608">26:48</a> 营造法式与华林寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1868">31:08</a> 日本镰仓时期大佛样</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2211">36:51</a> 宋高宗赵构与佞臣王继先</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/655f3d3fd0028fb4cb97d4aa" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/655f3d3fd0028fb4cb97d4aa"><span>02 不购物就不会生气 | Walkie Talkie</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
