    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq9gIwBZoor2_T_K5Oakyejc4omf.png"></figure><p><span>双11被气到“吐血”，本想发发牢骚，没想到聊着聊着，变成国货美妆及护肤品种草…</span></p><p><span>本期邀请达摩（aka美妆博主）聊聊这次双11踩的坑，聊了聊她持续回购多年的国货化妆品，快来抄作业！</span></p><p><strong><span>-内容导航–</span></strong></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="150">02:30</a>双11预售赠品变了、刚买就降价、赠品漏发、保价机制就是笑话</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1410">23:30</a>国货化妆品掏心窝子大推荐</span></p><p><strong><span>-种草清单 -</span></strong></p><p><span>👩🏻</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483731&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=81565ae36df6799f22a868f13869a584&amp;chksm=cf5cecddf82b65cb4e61922d011d6f86a92812eda62cf0373c9b9fb9ce3825aed4e34a802e71#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483731&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=81565ae36df6799f22a868f13869a584&amp;chksm=cf5cecddf82b65cb4e61922d011d6f86a92812eda62cf0373c9b9fb9ce3825aed4e34a802e71#rd"><span>查看：彩妆&amp;护肤品推荐</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-上集回顾-</span></strong></p><p><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/653aab8371783f853fb17f3a" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episodes/653aab8371783f853fb17f3a"><span>01 响堂山石窟：一千四百多年前，北齐的华美一瞬</span></a></p><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
