    <title>01 响堂山石窟：一千四百多年前，北齐的华美一瞬</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/653aab8371783f853fb17f3a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">653aab8371783f853fb17f3a</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 26 Oct 2023 18:10:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl2Q0L7edsZhPRwV25sqAYvhhYT_.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>响堂山石窟是对河北省邯郸市峰峰矿区北响堂、南响堂、水浴寺的统称，开凿始于北齐（550年-577年）。北响堂有北齐王室资助开凿的最早和最大的3个洞窟：《资治通鉴》提及的高欢墓在大佛洞、释迦洞残存北齐风格的胁侍菩萨像、中国大面积摩崖刻佛经始于刻经洞。位于滏口陉的南响堂，第7窟存有精妙绝伦的八身飞天壁画，“覆钵式塔”外立面也保存较好。</span></p><span></span><p><span>📿</span><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483714&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4a234b548134575aa2dcdb5d17ecdc4c&amp;chksm=cf5cecccf82b65da00fc148f003527696798ed03b28fdee2c404f2ab5ac736d1636faf2f3826#rd" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg4MTk4MjY4OQ==&amp;mid=2247483714&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=4a234b548134575aa2dcdb5d17ecdc4c&amp;chksm=cf5cecccf82b65da00fc148f003527696798ed03b28fdee2c404f2ab5ac736d1636faf2f3826#rd"><span>查看「响堂山石窟」图文信息</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-内容导航-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="85">01:25</a>响堂山石窟是个啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a>北魏东魏的权臣高欢</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="330">05:30</a>高洋废东魏建北齐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="445">07:25</a>常乐寺是座什么寺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a>流失海外的响堂山石刻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="805">13:25</a>在大佛洞被吓得半死</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="878">14:38</a>中心柱塔庙窟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1000">16:40</a>让人哇塞的北齐佛教艺术</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1174">19:34</a>高欢墓到底在不在大佛洞</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1337">22:17</a>宝珠火焰纹有多美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1502">25:02</a>释迦洞的窟门是艺术品</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1620">27:00</a>崖壁刻经始于北齐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1880">31:20</a>齐后主高纬死于北周</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2048">34:08</a>南响堂仅存半颗主佛佛头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2083">34:43</a>北齐“去汉化”僧服改制</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2195">36:35</a>被搬空的南响堂2-6窟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2375">39:35</a>覆钵式塔形窟</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2590">43:10</a>飞天壁画称得上半个国宝吧</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>-我在这里-</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>公众号：路见笔记</span></p><span></span><p><span>小宇宙 | 喜马拉雅：路见笔记</span></p>]]></description>
